  "result": "Perfect! All 55 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })** \u2014 Modifies a draft invoice by:\n- Adding a new line if the SKU doesn't exist\n- Increasing qty if the SKU already exists\n- Validates qty and SKU with same error codes as createInvoice\n- Returns fail('NOT_DRAFT') if invoice isn't in draft status\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku)** \u2014 Modifies a draft invoice by:\n- Removing the line with that SKU\n- Returns fail('LINE_NOT_FOUND') if SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns fail('NO_LINES') if it's the last line (invoice must have at least one)\n- Returns fail('NOT_DRAFT') if invoice isn't in draft status\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n**New error codes:** `NOT_DRAFT` and `LINE_NOT_FOUND`\n\n**16 new tests** covering:\n- Adding new lines and increasing existing quantities\n- Removing lines from various positions\n- All error cases (NOT_DRAFT, QTY_INVALID variants, UNKNOWN_SKU, LINE_NOT_FOUND, NO_LINES)\n- Immutability of both functions",
